9 Marketing and the market	64	Define 'marketing'.	Identifying customer wants and satisfying them profitably.	Definition
9 Marketing and the market	65	State four main functions/roles of a Marketing department.	Identifying customer needs, 2) Satisfying customer needs, 3) Maintaining customer loyalty, 4) Building customer relationships.	4-Mark
