13 The marketing mix: place	84	Outline the four main distribution channels.	Producer -> Consumer. 2) Producer -> Retailer -> Consumer. 3) Producer -> Wholesaler -> Retailer -> Consumer. 4) Producer -> Agent -> Wholesaler -> Retailer -> Consumer.	4-Mark
