14 The marketing mix: promotion	88	Distinguish between informative advertising and persuasive advertising.	Informative: Gives detailed factual information about product features, price, and usage. Persuasive: Aims to create an attractive image/desire so customers buy into the brand lifestyle.	4-Mark
15 Ecommerce	89	Define 'ecommerce'.	The online buying and selling of goods and services using internet-connected electronic devices.	Definition
