24 Cash flow forecast	127	List four methods a business can use to overcome a short-term cash flow deficit.	Arrange a bank overdraft, 2) Delay supplier payments, 3) Encourage faster debtor payments, 4) Delay non-essential capital expenditure.	4-Mark
25 Profit and loss	128	What is the basic formula for calculating profit?	Profit = Total Revenue minus Total Costs.	2-Mark
